<urn:atm:triage:finding/AO1-BOUNDARY-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AO1-BOUNDARY-004" ;
  triage:title "New test assertion re-introduces forbidden 'select' substring, re-triggering boundary lint" ;
  triage:description "The AO1-REQQA-002 fix commit (bede69ff6) added a new test assertion assert!(!error.message().contains(select)) at crates/peer-tls/src/lib.rs:503, which itself contains the literal substring select and re-triggers the peer-tls boundary lint SQL-keyword collision check. just lint boundaries fails on both ubuntu and windows CI for PR #942 as a result. Reword the assertion so it no longer contains the forbidden token." ;
